          "response_portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/洛琪希_害羞_重绘统一服装.png",
          "intro_outcome": "success",
          "result": "lucky_start",
          "unlock_character": "hero_04",
          "follow_up": [
            {
              "speaker": "洛琪希",
              "text": "你连名字都念不出来，倒是没有假装认识。我先跟你走，问路费算在第一节课里。",
              "expression": "傲娇",
              "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/洛琪希_傲娇_重绘统一服装.png",
              "highlight": "main"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "洛琪希小姐，我们被魔族包围了！",
          "response": "我姑且也是魔族哦。",
          "response_speaker": "洛琪希",
          "response_expression": "不悦",
          "response_portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/洛琪希_不悦_重绘统一服装.png",
          "intro_outcome": "roxy_departure",
          "result": "roxy_departure",
          "follow_up": [
            {
              "speaker": "洛琪希",
              "text": "你看，包围圈现在少了一位家庭教师。下次求救之前，先把人认对。",
              "expression": "不悦",
              "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/洛琪希_不悦_重绘统一服装.png",
              "highlight": "main"
